  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut pumpkin into bite-sized chunks. <br>• Slice red onion into thick wedges.<br>• Halve snacking tomatoes. <br>• Roughly chop walnuts.</p> <p><br>TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer and scrape out <br>the seeds, if necessary! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-71475e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place pumpkin and onion on a lined oven <br>tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with herb &amp; <br>mushroom seasoning and toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-d077a910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, on <br>a second lined oven tray, evenly stack 5 sheets <br>of filo pastry (see ingredients) (one stack per <br>person) with a drizzle of olive oil between <br>each layer.<br>• When cooked, place roasted onion and <br>pumpkin in the centre of the pastry, leaving a <br>4cm border around the edge.<br>• Cut marinated goat cheese into bite-sized <br>chunks. Top veggies with cheese. Season with a <br>pinch of salt and pepper.<br>• Carefully fold pastry edges over filling, leaving <br>the centre exposed.</p> <p><br>TIP: Use the same lined oven tray from the pumpkin <br>to cook your pastry, for extra flavour! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-1a331c20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Brush edges of pastry with olive oil. <br>• Bake galette, until golden, 15-20 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-842a5e30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine snacking <br>tomatoes, spinach &amp; rocket mix and balsamic <br>vinaigrette dressing. Season with salt and <br>pepper to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-c312f440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cut galette. <br>• Divide pumpkin and goat cheese galette <br>between plates. <br>• Sprinkle walnuts and a pinch of chilli flakes<br>(if using) over the galette. <br>• Serve with cherry tomato salad and Italian <br>truffle mayonnaise. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68197485939c9c3068924ada/step-7ec08f50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
